WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.200
The work does not end when the contract is signed.

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:13.290
Record the award. Velstrian Buy works out the standstill period where it applies, and drafts award and regret letters for you to review.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:18.700
Then score the supplier and hold regular reviews, kept in the supplier record.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:20.390
Keep contracts on track.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:21.960
Velstrian Buy.
